{"seq":2,"slug":"delay-notice-compensation","title":"延期发货通知与赔付","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/presale-crowdfunding-order/crowdfunding-goal-risk/delay-notice-compensation","wordCount":2772,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"延期发货通知与赔付\">延期发货通知与赔付</h1><p>预售的承诺日期一旦滑移，事件性质就变了：它从一次营销承诺变成一次合同履行问题。延期不是纯技术事故，它有<strong>通知义务</strong>、有<strong>赔付后果</strong>，而且赔付模型会直接吞噬商家的单位经济。这一篇讲三件事：延期怎么分级、通知怎么编排才可靠、赔付怎么按阶梯计算并与退款权共存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>延期的处理链是&quot;检测 → 分级 → 通知 → 赔付 → 记账&quot;，每一环都有明确的所有者与失败模式。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[承诺快照 vs 新预期] --&gt; B{超出容忍阈值?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[仅更新内部预期]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D[延期分级]&#10;    D --&gt; E{分级结果}&#10;    E --&gt;|轻度| F[通知 + 可选补偿]&#10;    E --&gt;|重大| G[通知 + 赔付 + 开放退款]&#10;    E --&gt;|不可履行| H[通知 + 全额退款 + 关闭订单]&#10;    G --&gt; I[赔付记账]&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    F --&gt; I\">graph TD\n    A[承诺快照 vs 新预期] --&gt; B{超出容忍阈值?}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[仅更新内部预期]\n    B --&gt;|是| D[延期分级]\n    D --&gt; E{分级结果}\n    E --&gt;|轻度| F[通知 + 可选补偿]\n    E --&gt;|重大| G[通知 + 赔付 + 开放退款]\n    E --&gt;|不可履行| H[通知 + 全额退款 + 关闭订单]\n    G --&gt; I[赔付记账]\n    H --&gt; I\n    F --&gt; I</pre><p>分级的意义在于<strong>避免一刀切</strong>。一天的生产波动不值得惊动全部用户，三周的产能崩盘必须主动披露。分级的两个维度是延期幅度与可履行性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分级</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>用户后果</th>\n<th>商家义务</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>轻度延期</td>\n<td>超出承诺日但在容忍窗口内</td>\n<td>收到通知</td>\n<td>告知新日期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重大延期</td>\n<td>超出容忍窗口</td>\n<td>收到通知，可选赔付</td>\n<td>赔付 + 支持无理由退款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可履行</td>\n<td>批次取消或产能无法恢复</td>\n<td>全额退款</td>\n<td>退款 + 违约赔偿</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三个分级&quot;不可履行&quot;必须单独存在。把它混进&quot;重大延期&quot;会导致一个已经无法交付的订单继续停留在待发货状态，用户等到最后才发现根本没有货——这是投诉升级为监管投诉的主要路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延期检测的触发源\">延期检测的触发源</h2><h3 id=\"基于快照的偏差计算\">基于快照的偏差计算</h3><p>延期的判定基准只有一个：下单时快照的承诺日期（见 <a href=\"../presale-order-inventory/production-leadtime-delivery-promise\">生产周期与发货承诺</a>）。任何重算出来的日期都只是&quot;新预期&quot;，只有当新预期超出快照加容忍窗口时才构成延期。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>new_expect</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>snapshot_promise</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>延期</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = t_{\\text{new\\_expect}} - t_{\\text{snapshot\\_promise}}, \\qquad \\text{延期} \\iff \\Delta &gt; \\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9821em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new_expect</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">snapshot_promise</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">延期</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 是容忍窗口（以天为单位）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 必须是按品类配置的<strong>数据</strong>，不是代码常量——因为不同品类的批次波动率差异极大。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三个检测来源\">三个检测来源</h3><p>延期可能由供应侧、产能侧、尾程侧三类事件触发，它们的检测方式不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>供应侧</strong>（批次延期/取消）：由批次状态变更事件触发，影响该批次的全部订单。</li>\n<li><strong>产能侧</strong>（排产推后）：由排产计划变更触发，按排产顺序影响部分订单。</li>\n<li><strong>尾程侧</strong>（清关滞留/运力紧张）：由物流事件触发，影响特定市场。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三类都必须收敛到同一个&quot;重新评估承诺&quot;的入口，避免三套逻辑各自调用通知，造成同一用户收到三条互相矛盾的延期通知。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE commitment_reassessment (&#10;  reassessment_id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  order_id        BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  trigger_kind    TEXT NOT NULL&#10;                  CHECK (trigger_kind IN (&#39;SUPPLY&#39;,&#39;CAPACITY&#39;,&#39;TAIL_MILE&#39;,&#39;MANUAL&#39;)),&#10;  trigger_ref     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  old_promise     DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  new_expect      DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  delta_days      INTEGER NOT NULL,&#10;  tier            TEXT NOT NULL&#10;                  CHECK (tier IN (&#39;NONE&#39;,&#39;MINOR&#39;,&#39;MAJOR&#39;,&#39;UNDELIVERABLE&#39;)),&#10;  decided_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  UNIQUE (order_id, trigger_kind, trigger_ref)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_reassessment_actionable&#10;  ON commitment_reassessment (tier, decided_at)&#10;  WHERE tier &lt;&gt; &#39;NONE&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> commitment_reassessment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reassessment_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trigger_kind    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (trigger_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SUPPLY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CAPACITY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TAIL_MILE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'MANUAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trigger_ref     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  old_promise     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  new_expect      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  delta_days      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tier            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (tier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NONE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'MINOR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'MAJOR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UNDELIVERABLE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id, trigger_kind, trigger_ref)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_reassessment_actionable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> commitment_reassessment (tier, decided_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'NONE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>UNIQUE (order_id, trigger_kind, trigger_ref)</code> 是这里的关键约束：同一个触发源对同一订单只会产生一条重评估记录。没有它，一个批次延期事件被消息队列重复投递时会产生多条记录，进而发出多条通知、算多次赔付。</p>\n<h2 id=\"通知编排\">通知编排</h2><h3 id=\"通知的幂等与频控\">通知的幂等与频控</h3><p>通知编排有两个必须解决的问题：<strong>重复发送</strong>与<strong>过度发送</strong>。前者由 <code>UNIQUE (order_id, trigger_kind, trigger_ref)</code> 加通知日志的唯一键解决；后者需要一个频控规则——同一订单在 N 天内只发一次延期通知，除非分级上升。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE delay_notice (&#10;  notice_id      BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  order_id       BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  reassessment_id BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  channel        TEXT NOT NULL&#10;                 CHECK (channel IN (&#39;EMAIL&#39;,&#39;PUSH&#39;,&#39;SMS&#39;,&#39;IN_APP&#39;)),&#10;  locale         TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  tier           TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  state          TEXT NOT NULL&#10;                 CHECK (state IN (&#39;QUEUED&#39;,&#39;SENT&#39;,&#39;DELIVERED&#39;,&#39;FAILED&#39;,&#39;SUPPRESSED&#39;)),&#10;  suppress_reason TEXT,&#10;  sent_at        TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  UNIQUE (order_id, reassessment_id, channel)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> delay_notice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  notice_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reassessment_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (channel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'EMAIL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PUSH'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SMS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'IN_APP'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  locale         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tier           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'QUEUED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SENT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DELIVERED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FAILED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SUPPRESSED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  suppress_reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sent_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id, reassessment_id, channel)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>suppress_reason</code> 让&quot;为什么没通知这个用户&quot;成为可回答的问题。在监管问询或用户投诉中，&quot;我们按频控规则抑制了重复通知&quot;和&quot;我们漏发了&quot;是完全不同的两件事，而这个字段就是区分它们的依据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"多渠道退化的顺序\">多渠道退化的顺序</h3><p>通知渠道是<strong>有序退化</strong>的：优先低成本、可留痕的渠道（邮件、应用内），失败后升级到手机关联更强的渠道（推送），最后才是短信。顺序不能反——先用短信会让成本不可控，而短信的送达率优势在多渠道场景下并不显著。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[生成通知任务] --&gt; B[EMAIL 通道]&#10;    B --&gt; C{送达?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[标记 DELIVERED]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[PUSH 通道]&#10;    E --&gt; F{送达?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| D&#10;    F --&gt;|否| G[SMS 通道]&#10;    G --&gt; H{送达?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| D&#10;    H --&gt;|否| I[IN_APP 兜底 + 告警]\">graph LR\n    A[生成通知任务] --&gt; B[EMAIL 通道]\n    B --&gt; C{送达?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[标记 DELIVERED]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[PUSH 通道]\n    E --&gt; F{送达?}\n    F --&gt;|是| D\n    F --&gt;|否| G[SMS 通道]\n    G --&gt; H{送达?}\n    H --&gt;|是| D\n    H --&gt;|否| I[IN_APP 兜底 + 告警]</pre><h3 id=\"通知内容的合规要求\">通知内容的合规要求</h3><p>延期通知的内容不是自由创作。它至少要包含四项：<strong>新的预计日期</strong>（或明确的&quot;日期待定&quot;）、<strong>延期的原因类别</strong>（不要求披露商业细节，但要给出真实类别）、<strong>用户的选项</strong>（等待 or 退款）、以及<strong>赔付的说明</strong>（如有）。缺少&quot;用户的选项&quot;这一项，通知就退化成了单方面的通知，在消费者保护较严的市场容易被认定为不公平。</p>\n<h2 id=\"赔付模型\">赔付模型</h2><h3 id=\"阶梯赔付的计算\">阶梯赔付的计算</h3><p>赔付最常见的设计是<strong>按延期天数分段累加</strong>，而不是按比例线性。阶梯结构的好处是让赔付有上限、可预测，同时让早期的小幅延期不产生赔付。这种&quot;按后果严重度分档&quot;的思路在运输旅客权益领域有成熟先例：欧盟 261/2004 号条例对航班延误与取消的现金补偿就按航程分档——1500 公里以内 250 欧元，1500 至 3500 公里 400 欧元，超过 3500 公里 600 欧元；在改签后延误很短时可减半；并且规定来自&quot;即使采取一切合理措施也无法避免&quot;的异常情形时可以免除补偿，举证责任在承运人（见 <a href=\"https://europa.eu/youreurope/citizens/travel/passenger-rights/air/index_en.htm\">https://europa.eu/youreurope/citizens/travel/passenger-rights/air/index_en.htm</a> ）。预售赔付可以借用这套结构，但档位边界与金额必须由商业与法务决定，不能照搬。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\min\\left(C_{\\max}, \\sum_{i=1}^{k} w_i \\cdot \\max(0,\\; \\min(\\Delta, d_i) - d_{i-1})\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是阶梯边界（天），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 段每天的赔付系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是赔付上限。</p>\n<p>这个结构有一个工程含义必须写进实现：<strong>赔付必须按订单的最终延期天数一次性计算，而不是每天累加一次</strong>。按天累加会在延期继续发展时产生多条赔付记录，而每条记录的单笔退款都会触发一次支付通道调用，成本与出错面都大得多。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>延期天数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>赔付形式</th>\n<th>支付方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0 - 7</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8 - 14</td>\n<td>固定小额补偿</td>\n<td>原路部分退款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15 - 30</td>\n<td>按天累加</td>\n<td>原路部分退款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 30</td>\n<td>上限封顶，且开放全额退款</td>\n<td>原路部分退款或全额退款</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"赔付与退款的关系\">赔付与退款的关系</h3><p>赔付之后用户是否还保留退款权，是一个必须<strong>在条款里写清</strong>的问题，不能由实现细节决定。两种合法设计：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>赔付不影响退款权</strong>：用户拿到赔付后仍可全额退款，赔付作为违约金不冲抵。这对用户友好，对商家成本最高。</li>\n<li><strong>赔付后仍可退款，但退款时扣除已付赔付</strong>：这在部分司法辖区可能被视为变相限制退款权，需要法务确认。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>欧盟的规则给了一个明确的参照方向。在货物买卖中，消费者对不符合约定的商品享有分层的救济权：首先要求免费修理或更换，当修理更换不可能或在合理时间内无法完成时，才退到全部或部分退款、减价或解除合同；同时法律保证的最低保护期为自收货起两年，并且任何商业保证都不能排除或削弱这条底线（见 <a href=\"https://europa.eu/youreurope/citizens/consumers/shopping/guarantees-returns/index_en.htm\">https://europa.eu/youreurope/citizens/consumers/shopping/guarantees-returns/index_en.htm</a> ）。把它映射到预售延期上：<strong>把&quot;补偿&quot;定位成对等待成本的赔付，而不是对交付义务的替代</strong>，才符合&quot;商业保证不能削弱法定救济&quot;的原则。</p>\n<p>工程上无论选哪种，都需要一张独立的赔付记录表，与退款表分开，因为它们的<strong>会计科目不同</strong>：赔付是违约金/营销费用，退款是收入冲减。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE delay_compensation (&#10;  compensation_id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  order_id        BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  reassessment_id BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  basis_days      INTEGER NOT NULL,&#10;  amount          NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL CHECK (amount &gt;= 0),&#10;  currency        CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  form            TEXT NOT NULL&#10;                  CHECK (form IN (&#39;PARTIAL_REFUND&#39;,&#39;COUPON&#39;,&#39;NONE&#39;)),&#10;  state           TEXT NOT NULL&#10;                  CHECK (state IN (&#39;PENDING&#39;,&#39;APPLIED&#39;,&#39;FAILED&#39;,&#39;UNKNOWN&#39;)),&#10;  idempotency_key TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,&#10;  UNIQUE (order_id, reassessment_id)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> delay_compensation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  compensation_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reassessment_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  basis_days      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  form            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (form </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PARTIAL_REFUND'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'COUPON'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NONE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'APPLIED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FAILED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UNKNOWN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idempotency_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id, reassessment_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>UNIQUE (order_id, reassessment_id)</code> 保证一次重评估只产生一次赔付，<code>idempotency_key</code> 保证支付通道侧不重复执行。<code>UNKNOWN</code> 状态与退款场景同理——支付通道超时不代表没发生，必须交给对账而不是直接重试。</p>\n<h3 id=\"赔付上限的经济含义\">赔付上限的经济含义</h3><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的设定不是法律问题而是商业问题，但它有一个工程约束：<strong>赔付上限必须小于订单毛利</strong>，否则一次大规模延期会让整个活动变成负毛利。这个约束应该在活动配置阶段校验，而不是等到赔付执行时才发现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"ALTER TABLE presale_campaign&#10;  ADD CONSTRAINT chk_compensation_cap&#10;  CHECK (max_compensation &lt;= unit_price * 0.5);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> presale_campaign</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ADD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_compensation_cap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (max_compensation </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把&quot;赔付上限不超过售价一半&quot;写成数据库约束是保守但有意义的做法：它让任何一次配置错误在写入时就被拒绝，而不是在批量赔付时才发现资金缺口。</p>\n<h3 id=\"不可履行时的处理\">不可履行时的处理</h3><p>当分级为&quot;不可履行&quot;时，赔付与退款同时发生：全额退款是恢复原状，赔付是违约补偿。这里的执行顺序很重要——<strong>先退款再赔付</strong>。反过来的风险是赔付成功但退款失败，用户拿了一笔补偿却没拿回本金，这在争议处理中非常被动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"通知与赔付的可观测性\">通知与赔付的可观测性</h2><p>两个指标必须常设：<strong>延期订单占比</strong>（有多少订单发生过延期，按分级拆开）与<strong>赔付率</strong>（赔付金额 / 成交金额）。前者反映供应链稳定性，后者反映单位经济的侵蚀程度。两者都应当按批次与品类下钻——一个持续产生重大延期的供应商，其问题会在批次维度上暴露得最清楚。</p>\n<p>这份数据同时是下一轮承诺算法的输入：如果某品类的实际延期率长期高于容忍窗口的设计假设，说明该品类的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 或提前期参数需要调整，而不是继续用同一个承诺模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>延期判定必须以下单时的快照承诺为基准，重算日期只是&quot;新预期&quot;。</li>\n<li>分级至少要有三档，其中&quot;不可履行&quot;必须独立存在，否则无法交付的订单会滞留在待发货。</li>\n<li>三类触发源（供应/产能/尾程）必须收敛到同一个重评估入口，避免互相矛盾的通知。</li>\n<li><code>UNIQUE (order_id, trigger_kind, trigger_ref)</code> 让重评估幂等，是通知与赔付不重复的根基。</li>\n<li>通知要幂等、要频控，并且要能解释&quot;为什么没发&quot;（<code>suppress_reason</code>）。</li>\n<li>渠道按邮件 → 推送 → 短信 → 应用内有序退化，先便宜后贵。</li>\n<li>赔付按阶梯一次性计算而非按天累加，减少支付通道调用次数。</li>\n<li>赔付与退款必须分表记账（违约金 vs 收入冲减），并明确两者的关系。</li>\n<li>赔付上限应受毛利约束，且用数据库约束在配置阶段拦截。</li>\n<li>不可履行时先退款再赔付，避免用户拿了补偿却没拿回本金。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>需求不确定时该备多少货、超卖如何降级，见 <a href=\"presale-demand-uncertainty-supply\">需求不确定下的供应与超卖防控</a>；延期率与赔付率如何进入经营指标，见 <a href=\"../presale-ops-metric/presale-conversion-deposit-tail\">预售转化、定金转化与弃尾款</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"延期发货通知与赔付","id":"延期发货通知与赔付"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"延期检测的触发源","id":"延期检测的触发源"},{"level":3,"text":"基于快照的偏差计算","id":"基于快照的偏差计算"},{"level":3,"text":"三个检测来源","id":"三个检测来源"},{"level":2,"text":"通知编排","id":"通知编排"},{"level":3,"text":"通知的幂等与频控","id":"通知的幂等与频控"},{"level":3,"text":"多渠道退化的顺序","id":"多渠道退化的顺序"},{"level":3,"text":"通知内容的合规要求","id":"通知内容的合规要求"},{"level":2,"text":"赔付模型","id":"赔付模型"},{"level":3,"text":"阶梯赔付的计算","id":"阶梯赔付的计算"},{"level":3,"text":"赔付与退款的关系","id":"赔付与退款的关系"},{"level":3,"text":"赔付上限的经济含义","id":"赔付上限的经济含义"},{"level":3,"text":"不可履行时的处理","id":"不可履行时的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"通知与赔付的可观测性","id":"通知与赔付的可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"达标/stretch goal/未达标退款","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/presale-crowdfunding-order/crowdfunding-goal-risk/stretch-goal-threshold-refund"},"next":{"title":"需求不确定下的供应与超卖防控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/presale-crowdfunding-order/crowdfunding-goal-risk/presale-demand-uncertainty-supply"}}